      "writtenOn": "2018-02-24T00:45:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of updating curr-\u003erequested_voltage and curr-\u003erequested_current directly, I think it would be better to set local variables voltage and current in the switch case and then do:\n\ncurr-\u003erequested_voltage \u003d MIN(curr-\u003erequested_voltage, voltage);\ncurr-\u003erequested_current \u003d MIN(curr-\u003erequested_current, current);\n\nIt will ensure that we never provide more than what the battery requested.",
      "revId": "46ea9baac62446a8775993ce91e979281885f975",
